		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Un Poste pour un Consultant Décisionel avec Postgre en Luxembourg]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=446#p446"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Je suis d&#039;une agence de recrutment en Luxembourg et je cherche des candidats pour un poste de Consultant Décsionel avec Postgre.&#160; J&#039;ai inclus les détails du poste au-dessous;</p><p>French- and English speaking BI Expert.</p><p>Successful candidates must be able to prove the following skills &amp; experience:<br />•&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Several years of Business Intelligence experience;<br />•&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Very Good Knowledge on Open Source;<br />•&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Database Administration Expert (modeling and optimization);<br />•&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Java and Java Administration skills;<br />•&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Evaluation and testing experience of BI Open Source Solutions;<br />•&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Documentation experience;<br />•&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Software selection, test and package experience;<br />•&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; System migration experience;<br />•&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Fluent in French (written and spoken).</p><p>Tasks in this role will be:<br />•&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; The Evaluation of all Open Source BI software solutions;<br />•&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Support on Oracle and PostgreSQL Databases.</p><p>Cet poste est offert avec un contrat de 3 mois en Luxembourg</p><p>Si vous êtes intéresé nous envoyez votre cv à apply@charlesoakes.com</p><p>Merci</p>]]></content>
